{
 "esm": "1.0.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "SfclayRev",
  "description": "WRF's revised MM5 surface-layer scheme (sf_sfclay_physics = 1; Jimenez et al. 2012), transcribed from the CCPP kernel sf_sfclayrev_run of phys/physics_mmm/sf_sfclayrev.F90 (WRF 4.8, NCAR/MMM-physics 550b5b4 with the kind-generic fixes of the ctessum-claude fork 52cfbd7). The scheme is a diagnostic (time-step-free) Monin-Obukhov surface layer for one grid column: from the lowest-model-level state (u, v, T, qv, p, layer thickness), the surface pressure and skin temperature, the surface type and the previous step's roughness, friction velocity, temperature scale and surface humidity it computes (1) the potential, virtual and surface saturation quantities; (2) an effective wind speed that adds the Beljaars (1994) convective velocity over land or the Wyngaard form over water and the Mahrt and Sun (1995) subgrid velocity; (3) the bulk Richardson number Ri_b = g za (theta_v1 - theta_vs)/(theta_1 |U|^2), which fixes the stability regime (1 stable, 3 neutral, 4 unstable); (4) the stability parameter zol = za/L by inverting Ri_b = zol psi_h(zol)/psi_m(zol)^2 with the Jimenez et al. (2012) integrated similarity functions (Cheng-Brutsaert stable, Kansas/free-convection unstable), which the kernel does with a secant iteration stopped at 0.01 (bulk_richardson_zol.esm: transcribed step by step as one recurrence over the 33-cell index set secant_steps because the stopping rule leaves zol up to 8e-5 relative from the exact root), or from the first guess zol = Ri_b ln((za+z0)/z0) when the previous friction velocity is below 1 mm/s; (5) the integrated stability corrections psi_m, psi_h between z0 (or the thermal/moisture roughness z0t, z0q over water and for iz0tlnd > 0 over land) and the first level, 2 m and 10 m; (6) the friction velocity u* = k |U|/psi_m relaxed 50/50 against the previous value, the temperature scale mol = k (theta_1 - theta_s)/psi_h, the 2 m and 10 m diagnostics and the drag/exchange coefficients ck, cka, cd, cda; and (7), when surface fluxes are enabled (isfflx), the updated sea-surface roughness (Charnock + smooth flow, AHW, or Jimenez-Dudhia shallow water), the exchange coefficients flhc, flqc, chs, chs2, cqs2 and the sensible, latent and moisture fluxes. Every quantity is a scalar observed; the only array is the secant recurrence. Constants: lib/wrf_constants.esm as subsystem wrf; scheme constants sfclayrev_parameters.esm as subsystem par (note the kernel receives real32 copies of the WRF constants, g = 9.8100004, karman = 0.40000001, ep1 = 0.60836244, svp1 = 0.61119998, and its literals are default-real, which bounds the agreement of a real64 build with this component at about 1e-7 relative -- FORTRAN_BUGS.md N2, N10). Previous-step inputs are named *_in (WRF intent(inout) arguments read before being overwritten: znt, ust, mol, qsfc, hfx, qfx, ustm, chs, chs2, cqs2). Option flags are numeric parameters (isfflx, shalwater_z0, scm_force_flux as 0/1; isftcflx, iz0tlnd as 0/1/2). NOT transcribed: the KIM turbulent orographic form drag (if_kim_tofd), whose Fortran uses the uninitialised variable dx_factor on its own right-hand side (FORTRAN_BUGS.md B3), so cf = 0; the optional TKE-coupling ustm is included. lh is xlv qfx always, whereas the kernel leaves lh unassigned when isfflx is false or scm_force_flux is true (FORTRAN_BUGS.md N11). The 0.9 ln((z+z0)/z0) caps that the kernel applies to psi_m, psi_h, psi_h2, psi_m10, psi_h10 in the unstable regime only are applied unconditionally here, which is equivalent because the stable and neutral corrections are non-positive. Regime selection by the sign of zol inside the profile templates is equivalent to the kernel's selection by the sign of Ri_b because zol has the sign of Ri_b or is zero.",
  "license": "MIT",
  "tags": ["wrf", "surface-layer", "sfclayrev", "monin-obukhov", "revised-mm5", "observed-only"],
  "references": [
   {"citation": "Jimenez, P. A., Dudhia, J., Gonzalez-Rouco, J. F., Navarro, J., Montavez, J. P., and Garcia-Bustamante, E. (2012). A revised scheme for the WRF surface layer formulation. Mon. Wea. Rev. 140, 898-918."},
   {"citation": "Zhang, D. and Anthes, R. A. (1982). A high-resolution model of the planetary boundary layer -- sensitivity tests and comparisons with SESAME-79 data. J. Appl. Meteor. 21, 1594-1609 (the MM5 surface layer: regimes, u* and theta* relations)."},
   {"citation": "Beljaars, A. C. M. (1994). The parametrization of surface fluxes in large-scale models under free convection. Q. J. R. Meteorol. Soc. 121, 255-270."},
   {"citation": "Mahrt, L. and Sun, J. (1995). The subgrid velocity scale in the bulk aerodynamic relationship for spatially averaged scalar fluxes. Mon. Wea. Rev. 123, 3032-3041."},
   {"citation": "WRF 4.8 phys/physics_mmm/sf_sfclayrev.F90 lines 80-946 (sf_sfclayrev_run) and phys/module_sf_sfclayrev.F (wrapper)."}
  ]
 },
 "index_sets": {
  "secant_steps": {"kind": "interval", "size": 33}
 },
 "models": {
  "SfclayRev": {
   "expression_template_imports": [
    {"ref": "../../../lib/wrf_thermo.esm"},
    {"ref": "./sfclayrev_thermo.esm"},
    {"ref": "./similarity_functions.esm"},
    {"ref": "./bulk_richardson_zol.esm"},
    {"ref": "./surface_roughness.esm"}
   ],
   "subsystems": {
    "wrf": {"ref": "../../../lib/wrf_constants.esm"},
    "par": {"ref": "./sfclayrev_parameters.esm"}
   },
   "variables": {
    "u1": {"type": "parameter", "units": "m/s", "default": 2.0, "description": "Lowest-level zonal wind (WRF ux)."},
    "v1": {"type": "parameter", "units": "m/s", "default": -6.0, "description": "Lowest-level meridional wind (WRF vx)."},
    "t1": {"type": "parameter", "units": "K", "default": 284.0, "description": "Lowest-level temperature (WRF t1d)."},
    "qv1": {"type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "default": 0.003, "description": "Lowest-level water-vapour mixing ratio (WRF qv1d)."},
    "p1": {"type": "parameter", "units": "Pa", "default": 96800.0, "description": "Lowest-level pressure (WRF p1d)."},
    "dz1": {"type": "parameter", "units": "m", "default": 51.0, "description": "Thickness of the lowest model layer (WRF dz8w1d); the first level is at za = dz1/2."},
    "psfc": {"type": "parameter", "units": "Pa", "default": 97100.0, "description": "Surface pressure (WRF psfcpa)."},
    "mavail": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1", "default": 0.6, "description": "Surface moisture availability."},
    "pblh": {"type": "parameter", "units": "m", "default": 800.0, "description": "Boundary-layer depth of the previous step, used by the Beljaars convective velocity."},
    "tsk": {"type": "parameter", "units": "K", "default": 286.0, "description": "Skin temperature."},
    "xland": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1", "default": 1.0, "description": "Land mask: 1 land, 2 water (water when xland >= 1.5)."},
    "lakemask": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1", "default": 0.0, "description": "Lake mask (1 = lake: no salinity reduction of the surface saturation)."},
    "water_depth": {"type": "parameter", "units": "m", "default": 0.0, "description": "Water depth for the shallow-water roughness (shalwater_z0)."},
    "dx": {"type": "parameter", "units": "m", "default": 4000.0, "description": "Grid length, for the Mahrt-Sun subgrid velocity."},
    "znt_in": {"type": "parameter", "units": "m", "default": 0.05, "description": "Roughness length of the previous step (WRF znt on entry)."},
    "ust_in": {"type": "parameter", "units": "m/s", "default": 0.5, "description": "Friction velocity of the previous step (WRF ust on entry)."},
    "mol_in": {"type": "parameter", "units": "K", "default": -0.1, "description": "Temperature scale theta* of the previous step (WRF mol on entry); its sign keeps a previously unstable column out of the stable regime."},
    "qsfc_in": {"type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "default": 0.009, "description": "Surface mixing ratio of the previous step (WRF qsfc on entry; kept over land when positive)."},
    "hfx_in": {"type": "parameter", "units": "W/m^2", "default": 70.0, "description": "Sensible heat flux of the previous step (enters the Beljaars convective velocity; returned unchanged when scm_force_flux)."},
    "qfx_in": {"type": "parameter", "units": "kg/(m^2*s)", "default": 8e-5, "description": "Moisture flux of the previous step."},
    "ustm_in": {"type": "parameter", "units": "m/s", "default": 0.5, "description": "Friction velocity without the convective velocity, previous step (WRF ustm on entry)."},
    "chs_in": {"type": "parameter", "units": "m/s", "default": 0.0, "description": "Heat exchange coefficient of the previous step (returned unchanged when isfflx is off)."},
    "chs2_in": {"type": "parameter", "units": "m/s", "default": 0.0, "description": "2 m heat exchange coefficient of the previous step."},
    "cqs2_in": {"type": "parameter", "units": "m/s", "default": 0.0, "description": "2 m moisture exchange coefficient of the previous step."},
    "isfflx": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1", "default": 1.0, "description": "1: compute surface fluxes, roughness update and exchange coefficients; 0: skip them (WRF isfflx)."},
    "shalwater_z0": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1", "default": 0.0, "description": "1: depth-dependent sea roughness of Jimenez and Dudhia (2018)."},
    "scm_force_flux": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1", "default": 0.0, "description": "1: keep the prescribed hfx_in, qfx_in (single-column forcing)."},
    "isftcflx": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1", "default": 0.0, "description": "Sea-surface flux option: 0 Fairall z0t/z0q and Charnock z0; 1 z0q = 1e-4 m and AHW z0; 2 Garratt z0t/z0q and AHW z0."},
    "iz0tlnd": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1", "default": 0.0, "description": "Land thermal-roughness option: 0 none; 1 Zilitinkevich with the Chen-Zhang C_zil; 2 Zilitinkevich with C_zil = 0.1."},
    "is_water": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "1 over water (xland >= 1.5), 0 over land."},
    "exner1": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Exner function (p1/p1000mb)^(R_d/c_p) at the first level."},
    "exner_sfc": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Exner function at the surface."},
    "thgb": {"type": "unknown", "units": "K", "description": "Skin potential temperature tsk/exner_sfc (WRF thgb)."},
    "thx": {"type": "unknown", "units": "K", "description": "First-level potential temperature (WRF thx)."},
    "tvx": {"type": "unknown", "units": "K", "description": "First-level virtual temperature (WRF scr4)."},
    "thvx": {"type": "unknown", "units": "K", "description": "First-level virtual potential temperature (WRF thvx)."},
    "psfc_kpa": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kPa", "description": "Surface pressure in kPa (WRF psfc)."},
    "p1_kpa": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kPa", "description": "First-level pressure in kPa (WRF pl)."},
    "es_sfc": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kPa", "description": "Saturation vapour pressure at the skin temperature, reduced by the salinity factor over (non-lake) water."},
    "qsfc": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "description": "Surface mixing ratio: saturation at tsk over water or when the previous value is not positive, else the previous value (WRF qsfc)."},
    "es_air": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kPa", "description": "Saturation vapour pressure at the first-level temperature."},
    "qgh": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "description": "Saturation mixing ratio at the first level (WRF qgh, the LSM's q2sat)."},
    "cpm": {"type": "unknown", "units": "J/(kg*K)", "description": "Moist heat capacity cp (1 + 0.8 qv1) (WRF cpm)."},
    "rhox": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kg/m^3", "description": "Surface air density psfc/(R_d T_v1) (WRF rhox)."},
    "za": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m", "description": "Height of the first level above ground, dz1/2 (WRF za)."},
    "govrth": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m/(s^2*K)", "description": "g/theta_1 (WRF govrth)."},
    "gz1oz0": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "ln((za + z0)/z0) (WRF gz1oz0)."},
    "gz2oz0": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "ln((2 m + z0)/z0)."},
    "gz10oz0": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "ln((10 m + z0)/z0)."},
    "wspd0": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m/s", "description": "Resolved first-level wind speed sqrt(u1^2 + v1^2) (WRF wspdi)."},
    "tskv": {"type": "unknown", "units": "K", "description": "Surface virtual potential temperature thgb (1 + ep_1 qsfc) (WRF tskv)."},
    "dthvdz": {"type": "unknown", "units": "K", "description": "Virtual potential temperature difference thvx - tskv (WRF dthvdz)."},
    "fluxc": {"type": "unknown", "units": "K*m/s", "description": "Kinematic surface buoyancy flux max(hfx/(rho cp) + ep_1 tskv qfx/rho, 0) of the previous step (WRF fluxc)."},
    "vconv": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m/s", "description": "Convective velocity scale: Beljaars (1994) over land, sqrt(max(tskv - thvx, 0)) (old MM5/Wyngaard form) over water (WRF vconv)."},
    "vsgd": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m/s", "description": "Mahrt and Sun (1995) subgrid velocity 0.32 max(dx/5 km - 1, 0)^0.33 (WRF vsgd)."},
    "wspd": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m/s", "description": "Effective wind speed max(sqrt(wspd0^2 + vconv^2 + vsgd^2), 0.1 m/s) (WRF wspd)."},
    "br0": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Bulk Richardson number of the surface layer g za dthvdz/(theta_1 wspd^2) before the hysteresis clip."},
    "br": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Bulk Richardson number (WRF br): br0, but not allowed to become positive when the previous step was unstable (mol_in < 0)."},
    "ri_solve": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Bulk Richardson number passed to the zol solver, clamped to [-250, 250]."},
    "secant": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "shape": ["secant_steps"], "description": "The kernel's secant iteration for zol = za/L (function zolri), cell by cell: cells 1-3 hold the initial bracket x1_0, x2_0 (-5 and 0 for Ri_b < 0, 0 and 5 for Ri_b > 0) and r_0 = 0; cells 3n+1, 3n+2, 3n+3 hold x1_n, x2_n and the running return value r_n after update n = 1..10. An esm-spec 4.3.1.1 recurrence (each cell reads earlier cells only); the per-cell rules are the secant_* templates of bulk_richardson_zol.esm. Justification: the kernel does not converge this iteration (it stops when the bracket is narrower than 0.01), so the result depends on the iteration path and cannot be written as the root of the equation without an O(1e-4) discrepancy; the sweep is genuinely sequential."},
    "zol_secant": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Return value of the kernel's zolri: the last cell of the secant recurrence."},
    "zol": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Stability parameter za/L (WRF zol): the secant result for Ri_b /= 0 (the first-guess Ri_b ln((za+z0)/z0) instead when the previous u* is below 1 mm/s in the unstable regime), 0 in the neutral regime."},
    "regime": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Stability regime: 1 stable (Ri_b > 0), 3 forced convection (Ri_b = 0), 4 free convection (Ri_b < 0) (WRF regime)."},
    "rmol": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1/m", "description": "Inverse Monin-Obukhov length zol/za (WRF rmol)."},
    "psim": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Integrated momentum stability correction between z0 and za, capped at 0.9 ln((za+z0)/z0) (WRF psim)."},
    "psim10": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Integrated momentum correction between z0 and 10 m, capped at 0.9 ln((10+z0)/z0) (WRF psim10)."},
    "psim2": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Integrated momentum correction between z0 and 2 m (WRF psim2)."},
    "psih_z0": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Integrated heat correction between z0 and za, capped at 0.9 ln((za+z0)/z0) (WRF psih before any thermal-roughness recomputation)."},
    "psih2_z0": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Integrated heat correction between z0 and 2 m, capped (WRF psih2)."},
    "psih10_z0": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Integrated heat correction between z0 and 10 m, capped (WRF psih10)."},
    "zl_r": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m", "description": "Roughness of the moisture sublayer: z0 over water, 0.01 m over land (WRF zl)."},
    "pq": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Integrated heat correction between zl_r and za, for the land psiq (WRF pq)."},
    "pq2": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Integrated heat correction between zl_r and 2 m (WRF pq2)."},
    "pq10": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Integrated heat correction between zl_r and 10 m (WRF pq10)."},
    "dtg": {"type": "unknown", "units": "K", "description": "thx - thgb (WRF dtg)."},
    "psix": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Momentum profile function ln((za+z0)/z0) - psim (WRF psix = fm)."},
    "psix10": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Momentum profile function to 10 m (WRF psix10)."},
    "nu": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m^2/s", "description": "Kinematic viscosity of air at t1 (WRF visc)."},
    "restar": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Roughness Reynolds number ust_in z0/nu (WRF restar)."},
    "z0t_fairall": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m", "description": "Fairall et al. (2003) thermal roughness over water."},
    "z0t_garratt": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m", "description": "Garratt thermal roughness over water (isftcflx = 2)."},
    "z0q_garratt": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m", "description": "Garratt moisture roughness over water (isftcflx = 2)."},
    "czil": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Zilitinkevich coefficient over land: Chen-Zhang for iz0tlnd = 1, 0.1 for iz0tlnd = 2."},
    "z0t_land": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m", "description": "Zilitinkevich thermal roughness over land (iz0tlnd > 0)."},
    "thermal_roughness_active": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "1 when the heat and moisture profiles use their own roughness lengths (over water always; over land when iz0tlnd > 0)."},
    "z0t_eff": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m", "description": "Thermal roughness used by the temperature profile: water isftcflx 0 Fairall, 1 z0q_isftcflx1, 2 Garratt; land iz0tlnd > 0 Zilitinkevich; otherwise z0."},
    "z0q_eff": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m", "description": "Moisture roughness used by the humidity profile: water isftcflx 0 Fairall, 1 1e-4 m, 2 Garratt; land iz0tlnd > 0 the thermal roughness; otherwise z0."},
    "psih_t": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Integrated heat correction between z0t_eff and za (uncapped, as the kernel recomputes it)."},
    "psih2_t": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Integrated heat correction between z0t_eff and 2 m."},
    "psih_q": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Integrated heat correction between z0q_eff and za."},
    "psih2_q": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Integrated heat correction between z0q_eff and 2 m."},
    "psih10_q": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Integrated heat correction between z0q_eff and 10 m."},
    "psih": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Heat stability correction returned by the kernel (WRF psih): the z0q_eff profile when a thermal roughness is active, else the capped z0 profile."},
    "psit": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Temperature profile function ln((za+z0t)/z0t) - psih_t, or ln((za+z0)/z0) - psih_z0 without thermal roughness (WRF psit = fh)."},
    "psit2": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Temperature profile function to 2 m (WRF psit2 = denomt2)."},
    "psiq_pre": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Moisture profile function before the land thermal-roughness option: ln((za+z0q)/z0q) - psih_q over water, ln(k u* za/xka + za/0.01) - pq over land (the value the kernel uses in cka)."},
    "psiq": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Moisture profile function (WRF psiq = denomq): psiq_pre, or ln((za+z0t)/z0t) - psih_t over land with iz0tlnd > 0."},
    "psiq2": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Moisture profile function to 2 m (WRF psiq2 = denomq2)."},
    "psiq10": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Moisture profile function to 10 m (WRF psiq10; not modified by iz0tlnd)."},
    "ust_raw": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m/s", "description": "Friction velocity 0.5 ust_in + 0.5 k wspd/psix before the land floor."},
    "ust": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m/s", "description": "Friction velocity (WRF ust): floored at 1 mm/s over land."},
    "ustm": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m/s", "description": "Friction velocity from the resolved wind only, 0.5 ustm_in + 0.5 k wspd0/psix (WRF ustm)."},
    "mol": {"type": "unknown", "units": "K", "description": "Temperature scale theta* = k (thx - thgb)/(psit Pr_t) (WRF mol)."},
    "u10": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m/s", "description": "10 m zonal wind u1 psix10/psix."},
    "v10": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m/s", "description": "10 m meridional wind."},
    "th2": {"type": "unknown", "units": "K", "description": "2 m potential temperature thgb + dtg psit2/psit."},
    "t2": {"type": "unknown", "units": "K", "description": "2 m temperature th2 exner_sfc."},
    "q2": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "description": "2 m mixing ratio qsfc + (qv1 - qsfc) psiq2/psiq."},
    "fm": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Momentum profile function returned to the PBL scheme (= psix)."},
    "fh": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Heat profile function returned to the PBL scheme (= psit)."},
    "ck": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "10 m enthalpy exchange coefficient (k/psix10)(k/psiq10)."},
    "cka": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "First-level enthalpy exchange coefficient (k/psix)(k/psiq_pre)."},
    "cd": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "10 m drag coefficient (k/psix10)^2 (the orographic form drag cf is not transcribed)."},
    "cda": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "First-level drag coefficient (k/psix)^2."},
    "znt": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m", "description": "Roughness length (WRF znt on exit): over water with isfflx the AHW form (isftcflx /= 0), the shallow-water form (shalwater_z0) or the Charnock + smooth-flow form, from the updated u*; otherwise znt_in."},
    "flqc": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kg/(m^2*s)", "description": "Moisture exchange coefficient rho mavail u* k/psiq (WRF flqc; 0 when isfflx is off)."},
    "flhc": {"type": "unknown", "units": "W/(m^2*K)", "description": "Heat exchange coefficient cpm rho u* mol/(thx - thgb) (WRF flhc; 0 when |thx - thgb| <= 1e-5 K or isfflx is off)."},
    "qfx": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kg/(m^2*s)", "description": "Surface moisture flux flqc (qsfc - qv1); qfx_in when scm_force_flux; 0 when isfflx is off (WRF qfx)."},
    "hfx": {"type": "unknown", "units": "W/m^2", "description": "Surface sensible heat flux flhc (thgb - thx); hfx_in when scm_force_flux; 0 when isfflx is off (WRF hfx)."},
    "lh": {"type": "unknown", "units": "W/m^2", "description": "Latent heat flux xlv qfx (WRF lh; the kernel leaves lh unassigned when it does not compute qfx, FORTRAN_BUGS.md N11)."},
    "chs": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m/s", "description": "Heat exchange coefficient u* k/psiq (WRF chs; chs_in when isfflx is off)."},
    "chs2": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m/s", "description": "2 m heat exchange coefficient u* k/psit2 (WRF chs2)."},
    "cqs2": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m/s", "description": "2 m moisture exchange coefficient u* k/psiq2 (WRF cqs2)."}
   },
   "equations": [
    {"lhs": "is_water", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">=", "args": ["xland", 1.5]}, 1, 0]}},
    {"lhs": "exner1", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "exner_function", "bindings": {"p": "p1", "p0": "wrf.p1000mb", "kappa": "wrf.rcp"}}},
    {"lhs": "exner_sfc", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "exner_function", "bindings": {"p": "psfc", "p0": "wrf.p1000mb", "kappa": "wrf.rcp"}}},
    {"lhs": "thgb", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "theta_from_temperature", "bindings": {"T": "tsk", "exner": "exner_sfc"}}},
    {"lhs": "thx", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "theta_from_temperature", "bindings": {"T": "t1", "exner": "exner1"}}},
    {"lhs": "tvx", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "virtual_potential_temperature", "bindings": {"theta": "t1", "qv": "qv1", "ep_1": "wrf.ep_1"}}},
    {"lhs": "thvx", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "virtual_potential_temperature", "bindings": {"theta": "thx", "qv": "qv1", "ep_1": "wrf.ep_1"}}},
    {"lhs": "psfc_kpa", "rhs": {"op": "/", "args": ["psfc", 1000]}},
    {"lhs": "p1_kpa", "rhs": {"op": "/", "args": ["p1", 1000]}},
    {"lhs": "es_sfc", "rhs": {"op": "*", "args": [{"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "bolton_saturation_vapor_pressure", "bindings": {"T": "tsk", "svp1": "wrf.svp1", "svp2": "wrf.svp2", "svp3": "wrf.svp3", "svpt0": "wrf.svpt0"}}, {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "and", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["xland", 1.5]}, {"op": "==", "args": ["lakemask", 0]}]}, "par.salinity_factor", 1]}]}},
    {"lhs": "qsfc", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "or", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["xland", 1.5]}, {"op": "<=", "args": ["qsfc_in", 0]}]}, {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "saturation_mixing_ratio", "bindings": {"es": "es_sfc", "p": "psfc_kpa", "ep_2": "wrf.ep_2"}}, "qsfc_in"]}},
    {"lhs": "es_air", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "bolton_saturation_vapor_pressure", "bindings": {"T": "t1", "svp1": "wrf.svp1", "svp2": "wrf.svp2", "svp3": "wrf.svp3", "svpt0": "wrf.svpt0"}}},
    {"lhs": "qgh", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "saturation_mixing_ratio", "bindings": {"es": "es_air", "p": "p1_kpa", "ep_2": "wrf.ep_2"}}},
    {"lhs": "cpm", "rhs": {"op": "*", "args": ["wrf.cp", {"op": "+", "args": [1, {"op": "*", "args": ["par.cpm_qfac", "qv1"]}]}]}},
    {"lhs": "rhox", "rhs": {"op": "/", "args": ["psfc", {"op": "*", "args": ["wrf.r_d", "tvx"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "za", "rhs": {"op": "*", "args": [0.5, "dz1"]}},
    {"lhs": "govrth", "rhs": {"op": "/", "args": ["wrf.g", "thx"]}},
    {"lhs": "gz1oz0", "rhs": {"op": "log", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": ["za", "znt_in"]}, "znt_in"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "gz2oz0", "rhs": {"op": "log", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": ["par.z_2m", "znt_in"]}, "znt_in"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "gz10oz0", "rhs": {"op": "log", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": ["par.z_10m", "znt_in"]}, "znt_in"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "wspd0", "rhs": {"op": "sqrt", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": ["u1", "u1"]}, {"op": "*", "args": ["v1", "v1"]}]}]}},
    {"lhs": "tskv", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "virtual_potential_temperature", "bindings": {"theta": "thgb", "qv": "qsfc", "ep_1": "wrf.ep_1"}}},
    {"lhs": "dthvdz", "rhs": {"op": "-", "args": ["thvx", "tskv"]}},
    {"lhs": "fluxc", "rhs": {"op": "max", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": ["hfx_in", {"op": "*", "args": ["rhox", "wrf.cp"]}]}, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": ["wrf.ep_1", "tskv", "qfx_in"]}, "rhox"]}]}, 0]}},
    {"lhs": "vconv", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "<", "args": ["xland", 1.5]},
       {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "beljaars_convective_velocity", "bindings": {"g": "wrf.g", "T_sfc": "tsk", "h": "pblh", "buoyancy_flux": "fluxc", "coef": "par.vconvc", "expo": "par.vsgd_exp", "unit_velocity": "par.unit_velocity"}},
       {"op": "*", "args": ["par.unit_velocity", {"op": "sqrt", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "max", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["dthvdz"]}, 0]}, "par.unit_kelvin"]}]}]}]}},
    {"lhs": "vsgd", "rhs": {"op": "*", "args": ["par.vsgd_coef", {"op": "^", "args": [{"op": "max", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": ["dx", "par.dx_ref"]}, 1]}, 0]}, "par.vsgd_exp"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "wspd", "rhs": {"op": "max", "args": [{"op": "sqrt", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": ["wspd0", "wspd0"]}, {"op": "*", "args": ["vconv", "vconv"]}, {"op": "*", "args": ["vsgd", "vsgd"]}]}]}, "par.wspd_min"]}},
    {"lhs": "br0", "rhs": {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": ["govrth", "za", "dthvdz"]}, {"op": "*", "args": ["wspd", "wspd"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "br", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "<", "args": ["mol_in", 0]}, {"op": "min", "args": ["br0", 0]}, "br0"]}},
    {"lhs": "ri_solve", "rhs": {"op": "max", "args": [{"op": "min", "args": ["br", "par.br_max"]}, {"op": "-", "args": ["par.br_max"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "secant", "rhs": {"op": "aggregate", "args": [], "output_idx": ["k"], "ranges": {"k": {"from": "secant_steps"}},
      "expr": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "<=", "args": ["k", 3]},
        {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "==", "args": ["k", 1]},
           {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "<", "args": ["ri_solve", 0]}, {"op": "-", "args": ["par.secant_bracket"]}, 0]},
           {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "==", "args": ["k", 2]}, {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "<", "args": ["ri_solve", 0]}, 0, "par.secant_bracket"]}, 0]}]},
        {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "==", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["k", {"op": "*", "args": [3, {"op": "floor", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["k", 1]}, 3]}]}]}]}, 1]},
           {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "secant_x1_next", "bindings": {"x1": {"op": "index", "args": ["secant", {"op": "-", "args": ["k", 3]}]}, "x2": {"op": "index", "args": ["secant", {"op": "-", "args": ["k", 2]}]}, "ri": "ri_solve", "z": "za", "z0": "znt_in", "tol": "par.secant_tol"}},
           {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "==", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["k", {"op": "*", "args": [3, {"op": "floor", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["k", 1]}, 3]}]}]}]}, 2]},
              {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "secant_x2_next", "bindings": {"x1": {"op": "index", "args": ["secant", {"op": "-", "args": ["k", 4]}]}, "x2": {"op": "index", "args": ["secant", {"op": "-", "args": ["k", 3]}]}, "ri": "ri_solve", "z": "za", "z0": "znt_in", "tol": "par.secant_tol"}},
              {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "secant_result_next", "bindings": {"x1_prev": {"op": "index", "args": ["secant", {"op": "-", "args": ["k", 5]}]}, "x2_prev": {"op": "index", "args": ["secant", {"op": "-", "args": ["k", 4]}]}, "x1_new": {"op": "index", "args": ["secant", {"op": "-", "args": ["k", 2]}]}, "x2_new": {"op": "index", "args": ["secant", {"op": "-", "args": ["k", 1]}]}, "r_prev": {"op": "index", "args": ["secant", {"op": "-", "args": ["k", 3]}]}, "ri": "ri_solve", "z": "za", "z0": "znt_in", "tol": "par.secant_tol"}}]}]}]}}},
    {"lhs": "zol_secant", "rhs": {"op": "index", "args": ["secant", 33]}},
    {"lhs": "zol", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["br", 0]}, "zol_secant", {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "<", "args": ["br", 0]}, {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "<", "args": ["ust_in", "par.ust_min_land"]}, {"op": "*", "args": ["br", "gz1oz0"]}, "zol_secant"]}, 0]}]}},
    {"lhs": "regime", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["br", 0]}, 1, {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "<", "args": ["br", 0]}, 4, 3]}]}},
    {"lhs": "rmol", "rhs": {"op": "/", "args": ["zol", "za"]}},
    {"lhs": "psim", "rhs": {"op": "min", "args": [{"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "psi_m_profile", "bindings": {"zol": "zol", "z_hi": {"op": "+", "args": ["za", "znt_in"]}, "z_lo": "znt_in", "za": "za"}}, {"op": "*", "args": ["par.psi_limit_frac", "gz1oz0"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "psim10", "rhs": {"op": "min", "args": [{"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "psi_m_profile", "bindings": {"zol": "zol", "z_hi": {"op": "+", "args": ["par.z_10m", "znt_in"]}, "z_lo": "znt_in", "za": "za"}}, {"op": "*", "args": ["par.psi_limit_frac", "gz10oz0"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "psim2", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "psi_m_profile", "bindings": {"zol": "zol", "z_hi": {"op": "+", "args": ["par.z_2m", "znt_in"]}, "z_lo": "znt_in", "za": "za"}}},
    {"lhs": "psih_z0", "rhs": {"op": "min", "args": [{"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "psi_h_profile", "bindings": {"zol": "zol", "z_hi": {"op": "+", "args": ["za", "znt_in"]}, "z_lo": "znt_in", "za": "za"}}, {"op": "*", "args": ["par.psi_limit_frac", "gz1oz0"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "psih2_z0", "rhs": {"op": "min", "args": [{"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "psi_h_profile", "bindings": {"zol": "zol", "z_hi": {"op": "+", "args": ["par.z_2m", "znt_in"]}, "z_lo": "znt_in", "za": "za"}}, {"op": "*", "args": ["par.psi_limit_frac", "gz2oz0"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "psih10_z0", "rhs": {"op": "min", "args": [{"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "psi_h_profile", "bindings": {"zol": "zol", "z_hi": {"op": "+", "args": ["par.z_10m", "znt_in"]}, "z_lo": "znt_in", "za": "za"}}, {"op": "*", "args": ["par.psi_limit_frac", "gz10oz0"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "zl_r", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">=", "args": ["xland", 1.5]}, "znt_in", "par.z_landsub"]}},
    {"lhs": "pq", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "psi_h_profile", "bindings": {"zol": "zol", "z_hi": "za", "z_lo": "zl_r", "za": "za"}}},
    {"lhs": "pq2", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "psi_h_profile", "bindings": {"zol": "zol", "z_hi": "par.z_2m", "z_lo": "zl_r", "za": "za"}}},
    {"lhs": "pq10", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "psi_h_profile", "bindings": {"zol": "zol", "z_hi": "par.z_10m", "z_lo": "zl_r", "za": "za"}}},
    {"lhs": "dtg", "rhs": {"op": "-", "args": ["thx", "thgb"]}},
    {"lhs": "psix", "rhs": {"op": "-", "args": ["gz1oz0", "psim"]}},
    {"lhs": "psix10", "rhs": {"op": "-", "args": ["gz10oz0", "psim10"]}},
    {"lhs": "nu", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "kinematic_viscosity_of_air_linear", "bindings": {"T": "t1", "nu0": "par.visc_a", "dnu_dT": "par.visc_b", "T0": "par.visc_t0"}}},
    {"lhs": "restar", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "roughness_reynolds_number", "bindings": {"ust": "ust_in", "z0": "znt_in", "nu": "nu"}}},
    {"lhs": "z0t_fairall", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "fairall_scalar_roughness", "bindings": {"restar": "restar", "coef": "par.z0t_fairall_coef", "expo": "par.z0t_fairall_exp", "z_min": "par.z0t_water_min", "z_max": "par.z0t_water_max"}}},
    {"lhs": "z0t_garratt", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "garratt_scalar_roughness", "bindings": {"z0": "znt_in", "restar": "restar", "k": "par.garratt_k", "a": "par.garratt_a", "b": "par.garratt_b", "ratio": "par.prandtl_garratt"}}},
    {"lhs": "z0q_garratt", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "garratt_scalar_roughness", "bindings": {"z0": "znt_in", "restar": "restar", "k": "par.garratt_k", "a": "par.garratt_a", "b": "par.garratt_b", "ratio": "par.schmidt_garratt"}}},
    {"lhs": "czil", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "==", "args": ["iz0tlnd", 1]}, {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "chen_zhang_czil", "bindings": {"z0": "znt_in", "expo": "par.czil_cz_exp", "z0_ref": "par.czil_cz_z0ref"}}, "par.czil_ref"]}},
    {"lhs": "z0t_land", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "zilitinkevich_thermal_roughness", "bindings": {"z0": "znt_in", "restar": "restar", "czil": "czil", "karman": "wrf.karman"}}},
    {"lhs": "thermal_roughness_active", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "or", "args": [{"op": ">=", "args": ["xland", 1.5]}, {"op": ">=", "args": ["iz0tlnd", 1]}]}, 1, 0]}},
    {"lhs": "z0t_eff", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">=", "args": ["xland", 1.5]},
       {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "==", "args": ["isftcflx", 2]}, "z0t_garratt", {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "==", "args": ["isftcflx", 1]}, "par.z0q_isftcflx1", "z0t_fairall"]}]},
       {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">=", "args": ["iz0tlnd", 1]}, "z0t_land", "znt_in"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "z0q_eff", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">=", "args": ["xland", 1.5]},
       {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "==", "args": ["isftcflx", 2]}, "z0q_garratt", {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "==", "args": ["isftcflx", 1]}, "par.z0q_isftcflx1", "z0t_fairall"]}]},
       {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">=", "args": ["iz0tlnd", 1]}, "z0t_land", "znt_in"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "psih_t", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "psi_h_profile", "bindings": {"zol": "zol", "z_hi": {"op": "+", "args": ["za", "z0t_eff"]}, "z_lo": "z0t_eff", "za": "za"}}},
    {"lhs": "psih2_t", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "psi_h_profile", "bindings": {"zol": "zol", "z_hi": {"op": "+", "args": ["par.z_2m", "z0t_eff"]}, "z_lo": "z0t_eff", "za": "za"}}},
    {"lhs": "psih_q", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "psi_h_profile", "bindings": {"zol": "zol", "z_hi": {"op": "+", "args": ["za", "z0q_eff"]}, "z_lo": "z0q_eff", "za": "za"}}},
    {"lhs": "psih2_q", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "psi_h_profile", "bindings": {"zol": "zol", "z_hi": {"op": "+", "args": ["par.z_2m", "z0q_eff"]}, "z_lo": "z0q_eff", "za": "za"}}},
    {"lhs": "psih10_q", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "psi_h_profile", "bindings": {"zol": "zol", "z_hi": {"op": "+", "args": ["par.z_10m", "z0q_eff"]}, "z_lo": "z0q_eff", "za": "za"}}},
    {"lhs": "psih", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["thermal_roughness_active", 0.5]}, "psih_q", "psih_z0"]}},
    {"lhs": "psit", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["thermal_roughness_active", 0.5]}, {"op": "-", "args": [{"op": "log", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": ["za", "z0t_eff"]}, "z0t_eff"]}]}, "psih_t"]}, {"op": "-", "args": ["gz1oz0", "psih_z0"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "psit2", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["thermal_roughness_active", 0.5]}, {"op": "-", "args": [{"op": "log", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": ["par.z_2m", "z0t_eff"]}, "z0t_eff"]}]}, "psih2_t"]}, {"op": "-", "args": ["gz2oz0", "psih2_z0"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "psiq_pre", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">=", "args": ["xland", 1.5]},
       {"op": "-", "args": [{"op": "log", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": ["za", "z0q_eff"]}, "z0q_eff"]}]}, "psih_q"]},
       {"op": "-", "args": [{"op": "log", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": ["wrf.karman", "ust_in", "za"]}, "par.xka"]}, {"op": "/", "args": ["za", "zl_r"]}]}]}, "pq"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "psiq", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["thermal_roughness_active", 0.5]}, {"op": "-", "args": [{"op": "log", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": ["za", "z0q_eff"]}, "z0q_eff"]}]}, "psih_q"]}, "psiq_pre"]}},
    {"lhs": "psiq2", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["thermal_roughness_active", 0.5]},
       {"op": "-", "args": [{"op": "log", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": ["par.z_2m", "z0q_eff"]}, "z0q_eff"]}]}, "psih2_q"]},
       {"op": "-", "args": [{"op": "log", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": ["wrf.karman", "ust_in", "par.z_2m"]}, "par.xka"]}, {"op": "/", "args": ["par.z_2m", "zl_r"]}]}]}, "pq2"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "psiq10", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">=", "args": ["xland", 1.5]},
       {"op": "-", "args": [{"op": "log", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": ["par.z_10m", "z0q_eff"]}, "z0q_eff"]}]}, "psih10_q"]},
       {"op": "-", "args": [{"op": "log", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": ["wrf.karman", "ust_in", "par.z_10m"]}, "par.xka"]}, {"op": "/", "args": ["par.z_10m", "zl_r"]}]}]}, "pq10"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "ust_raw", "rhs": {"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [0.5, "ust_in"]}, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [0.5, "wrf.karman", "wspd"]}, "psix"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "ust", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "<", "args": ["xland", 1.5]}, {"op": "max", "args": ["ust_raw", "par.ust_min_land"]}, "ust_raw"]}},
    {"lhs": "ustm", "rhs": {"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [0.5, "ustm_in"]}, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [0.5, "wrf.karman", "wspd0"]}, "psix"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "mol", "rhs": {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": ["wrf.karman", "dtg"]}, {"op": "*", "args": ["psit", "par.prt"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "u10", "rhs": {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": ["u1", "psix10"]}, "psix"]}},
    {"lhs": "v10", "rhs": {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": ["v1", "psix10"]}, "psix"]}},
    {"lhs": "th2", "rhs": {"op": "+", "args": ["thgb", {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": ["dtg", "psit2"]}, "psit"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "q2", "rhs": {"op": "+", "args": ["qsfc", {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["qv1", "qsfc"]}, "psiq2"]}, "psiq"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "t2", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "temperature_from_theta", "bindings": {"theta": "th2", "exner": "exner_sfc"}}},
    {"lhs": "fm", "rhs": "psix"},
    {"lhs": "fh", "rhs": "psit"},
    {"lhs": "ck", "rhs": {"op": "*", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": ["wrf.karman", "psix10"]}, {"op": "/", "args": ["wrf.karman", "psiq10"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "cka", "rhs": {"op": "*", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": ["wrf.karman", "psix"]}, {"op": "/", "args": ["wrf.karman", "psiq_pre"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "cd", "rhs": {"op": "*", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": ["wrf.karman", "psix10"]}, {"op": "/", "args": ["wrf.karman", "psix10"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "cda", "rhs": {"op": "*", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": ["wrf.karman", "psix"]}, {"op": "/", "args": ["wrf.karman", "psix"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "znt", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "and", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["isfflx", 0.5]}, {"op": ">=", "args": ["xland", 1.5]}]},
       {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "!=", "args": ["isftcflx", 0]},
          {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "sea_roughness_ahw", "bindings": {"ust": "ust", "g": "wrf.g", "u_ref": "par.ahw_ust_ref", "zw_exp": "par.ahw_zw_exp", "charnock": "par.ahw_charnock", "ozo": "par.ozo", "zn2_coef": "par.ahw_zn2_coef", "zn2_exp": "par.ahw_zn2_exp", "zn2_ust_exp": "par.ahw_zn2_ust_exp", "unit_velocity": "par.unit_velocity", "c_smooth": "par.z0_smooth_coef", "nu": "par.nu_sea", "ust_min": "par.ahw_ust_min", "z0_min": "par.z0_water_min_ahw", "z0_max": "par.z0_water_max"}},
          {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["shalwater_z0", 0.5]},
             {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "shallow_water_roughness", "bindings": {"depth": "water_depth", "ust": "ust", "depth_min": "par.shal_depth_min", "depth_max": "par.shal_depth_max", "b_coef": "par.shal_b_coef", "b_scale": "par.shal_b_scale", "c1": "par.shal_c1", "c2": "par.shal_c2", "c3": "par.shal_c3", "z0_max": "par.shal_z0_max", "unit_length": "par.unit_length"}},
             {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "sea_roughness_charnock_smooth", "bindings": {"ust": "ust", "g": "wrf.g", "czo": "par.czo", "c_smooth": "par.z0_smooth_coef", "nu": "par.nu_sea", "z0_max": "par.z0_water_max"}}]}]},
       "znt_in"]}},
    {"lhs": "flqc", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["isfflx", 0.5]}, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": ["rhox", "mavail", "ust", "wrf.karman"]}, "psiq"]}, 0]}},
    {"lhs": "flhc", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "and", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["isfflx", 0.5]}, {"op": ">", "args": [{"op": "abs", "args": ["dtg"]}, "par.dtthx_min"]}]}, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": ["cpm", "rhox", "ust", "mol"]}, "dtg"]}, 0]}},
    {"lhs": "qfx", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["scm_force_flux", 0.5]}, "qfx_in", {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["isfflx", 0.5]}, {"op": "*", "args": ["flqc", {"op": "-", "args": ["qsfc", "qv1"]}]}, 0]}]}},
    {"lhs": "hfx", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["scm_force_flux", 0.5]}, "hfx_in", {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["isfflx", 0.5]}, {"op": "*", "args": ["flhc", {"op": "-", "args": ["thgb", "thx"]}]}, 0]}]}},
    {"lhs": "lh", "rhs": {"op": "*", "args": ["wrf.xlv", "qfx"]}},
    {"lhs": "chs", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["isfflx", 0.5]}, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": ["ust", "wrf.karman"]}, "psiq"]}, "chs_in"]}},
    {"lhs": "cqs2", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["isfflx", 0.5]}, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": ["ust", "wrf.karman"]}, "psiq2"]}, "cqs2_in"]}},
    {"lhs": "chs2", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["isfflx", 0.5]}, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": ["ust", "wrf.karman"]}, "psit2"]}, "chs2_in"]}}
   ],
   "tests": [
     {
       "id": "scm_call1_first_step_unstable_land",
       "description": "Reference: WRF 4.8 em_scm_xy single-column run (GNU real32 build, dt = 60 s, mp=6 ra_lw=1 ra_sw=1 sf_sfclay_physics=1 sf_surface=1 bl_pbl=1, `data/eqwefic/scm_ref`) dumped around the sf_sfclayrev_run call by the instrumented ctessum-claude/WRF fork (e42a269, module_esm_dump) and replayed through the real64 (kind_phys = real64) standalone kernels/sfclayrev_driver of that fork against the ctessum-claude/MMM-physics kernel 52cfbd7 (NCAR/MMM-physics 550b5b4 plus kind-generic fixes). Inputs are the dumped kernel arguments (real32 values widened to real64 exactly as the driver read them); every expected value is the real64 replay's output. The scheme is diagnostic (no time step), so the values are pointwise. Tolerances: measured against the real64 replay with zero tolerances, the mismatch of this component is <= 4e-6 relative and is concentrated in the quantities that pass through the small virtual-temperature difference theta_v1 - theta_vs (Ri_b, zol, rmol, psi_m, psi_h, theta*, hfx: 2.7e-6 to 3.9e-6) and in what they feed (exchange and drag coefficients, fluxes, 10 m/2 m diagnostics: 1e-6 to 2e-6); the direct thermodynamic quantities (cpm, qgh, gz1oz0, wspd, znt) agree to better than 1e-6. Cause: the kernel receives real32 copies of the WRF constants (svpt0 = 273.1499939 K, whose 6e-6 K offset moves the skin saturation mixing ratio by 4e-7 relative and hence theta_vs by 6e-7 K, which is 2e-6 of the 0.3 K virtual-temperature difference; g = 9.8100004, karman = 0.40000001, ep1 = 0.60836244, svp1 = 0.61119998) and evaluates its default-real literals (1/2.5, sqrt(3), atan(1), the table nodes n*0.01) in single precision, while this component uses the nominal values from lib/wrf_constants.esm; the real32 in-model dump differs from the real64 replay by up to 1.7e-5 (zol). Tolerances are therefore rel 2e-5 (5x the measured floor) on every quantity downstream of theta_v1 - theta_vs and rel 1e-6 on the rest; regime is exact. Regime: SCM call 1 (the first physics step, 19:00 UTC = 12:34 LST): land, Ri_b = -0.058 (regime 4, free convection) with the previous-step friction velocity at its 1e-4 m/s initial value, so the kernel takes the first-guess branch zol = Ri_b ln((za+z0)/z0) instead of the secant solver; the previous heat fluxes are zero (no convective velocity) and the previous surface humidity is zero, so qsfc is the skin saturation value.",
       "parameter_overrides": {
         "u1": 3.0,
         "v1": -9.0,
         "t1": 283.3756103515625,
         "qv1": 0.002500000176951289,
         "p1": 96825.0078125,
         "dz1": 51.17171859741211,
         "psfc": 97123.375,
         "mavail": 0.6000000238418579,
